#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:5 b94b4a85517843afa2280e34effaece2
msgid "Inverted Flight"
msgstr "倒飞"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:7 f0858cbe27114930baa4d92d15104581
msgid ""
"Plane supports inverted flight. Inverted flight is initiated by setting an "
"RC channel via RCx_OPTION parameter."
msgstr "Plane 支持倒飞。倒飞通过 RCx_OPTION 参数设置 RC 通道来启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:10 070a80fb4f6d401e811150317185890d
msgid "Details"
msgstr "详细信息"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:12 c0145964a3704a42931d3fcb15917cef
msgid ""
"The RCx_OPTION parameter allows you to configure a transmitter switch to "
"enable inverted flight for fixed wing aircraft. To enable it, choose a RC "
"input channel which is not being used for anything else, and setup your "
"transmitter to give a PWM value larger than 1750 when a previously unused 2 "
"position switch is enabled, and a value below 1200 when it is not enabled."
msgstr ""
"RCx_OPTION 参数允许您配置遥控器开关以启用固定翼飞机的倒飞。要启用它，选择一个未用于其他用途的 RC "
"输入通道，并设置遥控器，使一个之前未使用的 2 位置开关启用时 PWM 值大于 1750，未启用时低于 1200。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:19 bc88e6eaca9c4879925545659e36a57b
msgid ""
"For example, if channel 7 is currently unused, and you set "
":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` to InvertedFlight (which has value 43) then if"
" your transmitter sends 1900 on channel 7 the plane will flip upside down "
"and continue flying in whatever mode it is in, but with the plane inverted."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果通道 7 当前未使用，并且将 :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` 设为 InvertedFlight（值为 "
"43），那么当遥控器在通道 7 上发送 1900 时，飞机将翻转过来继续以任何飞行模式飞行，但飞机处于倒置状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:25 c2e636fdb5e24e09b318b615c1be5564
msgid "Transmitter Setup"
msgstr "遥控器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:27 1616a11ad1a04990a7f4ba04253f25fe
msgid ""
"Enabling inverted flight only changes how ArduPilot stabilises the plane. It"
" will stabilise it with a roll of 180 degrees from normal whenever inverted "
"flight is enabled."
msgstr "启用倒飞仅改变 ArduPilot 稳定飞机的方式。启用倒飞时，它将以相对于正常状态 180 度横滚的姿态稳定飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:31 670b68301d2b46f881ae86fb8d896ebc
msgid ""
"To get the most out of inverted flight it can be useful to also invert your "
"transmitter elevator and rudder controls while your inverted flight switch "
"is enabled. This should be possible with any good transmitter."
msgstr "为充分利用倒飞，在启用倒飞开关时同时反转遥控器的升降舵和方向舵控制会很有用。任何好的遥控器都应能实现这一点。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:36 55fec30a557e40fa963ce017f5d560e7
msgid "Interaction with flight modes"
msgstr "与飞行模式的交互"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:38 494989dc9c764e01aceb4d9d9be24457
msgid ""
"Inverted flight can be used with any of the non-quadplane stabilized flight "
"modes (which means anything but manual mode). That means you can switch on "
"inverted flight during a mission and the plane will continue the mission "
"inverted. Make sure you disable it before trying to land!"
msgstr ""
"倒飞可以与任何非 QuadPlane "
"稳定飞行模式一起使用（即除手动模式以外的任何模式）。这意味着您可以在任务中途切换倒飞，飞机将以倒置状态继续任务。在尝试降落前确保将其关闭！"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:45 7ff2869b233140559f9a5b04615f30b2
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:47 0a3d52b4f3be4cec84f3e3c9b47e503f
msgid "Here are some general tips about inverted flight"
msgstr "以下是一些关于倒飞的一般技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:49 1705534576754d1095556ff627afd66a
msgid ""
"Try it out in simulation first to get used to it, and ensure your "
"transmitter is setup right."
msgstr "首先在模拟器中尝试以熟悉它，并确保遥控器设置正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:51 91dff76e4f57472d9fe507911702dfda
msgid ""
"make sure you have plenty of height before engaging or disengaging inverted "
"flight. Depending on your airframe, you could lose a lot of height while "
"flipping over, and it may be that your airframe struggles to maintain height"
" while inverted"
msgstr "在启用或禁用倒飞前，确保有足够的高度。根据您的机架，翻转时可能会损失大量高度，飞机在倒置时可能难以维持高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/inverted-flight.rst:55 f6f3207d438649fd93a6742a6e0f8ece
msgid ""
"make sure your ``PTCH2SRV_I`` value and ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` is high enough. "
"Planes commonly need more pitch trim while inverted to hold height."
msgstr "确保您的 ``PTCH2SRV_I`` 值和 ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` 足够高。飞机在倒置时通常需要更多俯仰配平来维持高度。"
